Bundled fonts:

Pneuma ships no font files. All text renders with the system font stack of the
device, and the app's CSS falls back through platform typefaces. This keeps the
APK small; the display fonts used by earlier releases (MiSans, 汇文明朝体,
Noto Serif SC, 龙藏, 喜脉喜欢体, 鸿雷小纸条青春体, 辰宇落雁体, Special Elite and the
Google Fonts families) are no longer redistributed here.

